    "body_excerpt": "Byway\nPRIVATE BETA\nGet your invite.\n\nByway is live and invite-only while we open it in stages.\n\nByway plans around your taste, verified places, real weather and opening hours \u2014 then opens every leg in Google Maps with one tap.\n\nMAPPED BYWAYS\n863\nLOOKOUTS\n2,095\nVERIFIED PLACES\n435,576\nEMAIL ADDRESS\nJoin private beta\n\nPrivate beta \u00b7 Free to join \u00b7 No card \u00b7 We'll send a code to confirm it's you\n\nAlready have an invite? Sign in\n\n\u00a9 2026 Byway Technologies LLC. All rights reserved.\n\n\u00b7\n\nByway\u2122 is a trademark of Byway Technologies LLC.\n\nCOOKIES\n\nNecessary cookies keep sign-in working. With your permission, analytics and session recordings help us improve the site. No ads, no cross-site tracking, no data sales.\n\nAccept all cookies\nReject all cookies\nPrivacy policy",
